#: features.js:647
msgid "Notifications are muted while you focus."
msgstr "Les notifications sont coupées pendant le focus."

#: features.js:650
msgid "Distraction blocking is ready — add sites in Settings → Advanced."
msgstr ""
"Le blocage des distractions est prêt — ajoutez des sites dans Paramètres → "
"Avancé."

