#: features.js:661
msgid "A calm theme, no ticking seconds and no end-of-timer rush."
msgstr ""
"Un thème apaisant, sans tic-tac des secondes ni précipitation en fin de "
"minuteur."

#: features.js:701
msgid "What will you mainly focus on?"
msgstr "Sur quoi allez-vous surtout vous concentrer ?"

#: features.js:702
msgid "This shapes how long each focus block should be."
